  "question": {
    "text": "The area (in sq. units) bounded by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> in the first and third quadrant is&nbsp;(where, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mo>.</mo></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is the greatest integer function),",
